scripts.features:
Wild Horse Islands - Features

🛡️Farm Helper: disables going afk and optimizes gui closure for better autofarm performance.

🐴 Horse Autofarm Section {

🐴 Auto Equip Lasso: automatically equip the lasso if you do not have it equipped already

🐴 Horse Autofarm Auto Click (J=ON,K=OFF): automatically clicks to collect the horse when farming, clicking J turns on and K turns off

🐴 AutoFarm Horses (Any Island): automatically teleports to the horses on any island to make farming faster

🐴 AutoFarm Horses (Select Island): automatically teleports to the horses on the island you select
}

💎Ore AutoFarm Section {

💎Auto Equip Harvester: automatically equip the harvester if you do not have it equipped already

💎Ore AutoFarm AutoClick: automatically clicks multiple places on your screen to select and start mining the ore

💎Disable rock collisions: disables colliding with rocks to make ore autofarms much smoother

💎AutoFarm Prismatic Gem: automatically teleports and starts farming prismatic gems on volcano island

💎AutoFarm AnyGem: automatically teleports and starts farming any unspecific gem in the game

💎AutoFarm Test Island Ores: automatically teleports and starts farming all gems on the test island.

🪨AutoFarm Rocks: automatically teleports and starts farming any rocks in the game

💎AutoFarm Specific Gem: automatically starts farming a specifically chosen gem inside of the game
}

🫒Collectable AutoFarm Section {
Auto Collect : automatically collects the collectable teleported to

🫒AutoFarm Collectables: automatically teleports to any collectable and collects it
}

🧾Receipt AutoFarm {
AutoFarm Receipts 1: supports most courses listed inside of the barn on training island

🧾AutoFarm Receipts 2: supports other courses listed inside of the barn on training island
}

🛡️Item Mods {

🛡️Reduce Lasso Cooldown: reduces your lasso throw time to basically 0

🛡️Expand Capture Radius: expands the radius of which you can throw your lasso

🛡️Disable Crafting Level Requirement: allows you to craft any lasso at any level
}

🧐ESP/Chams {

🧐Horse Esp: allows you to see the names of horses and where they are located

🧐Collectable Esp: allows you to see the names of certain collectables and where they are located

🧐Gem/Ore Esp: allows you to see any gem or rock and where they are located if they are loaded into the game
}

🙋‍♂️Character {

🙋‍♂️Speed Spoof: allows you to modify the walkspeed of your player

🙋‍♂️Velocity Fly: allows you to start flying at high speeds
}

📜Misc {

📜Horse Notifier: automatically sends you a notification if a rare horse exists

📜Delete Barriers: deletes all barriers that restrict you from flying across any island.
}
